{"municipality_code":"12227","pref":"千葉県","city":"浦安市","headline":"貴重な土木遺産があります。","display_comment_enriched":"浦安市には、当代島村、猫実村、堀江村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 まずは港町・水運、城跡・武家文化に目を向けると、地域の由緒をたどる手がかりが見つけやすいでしょう。 現地では当代島村、猫実村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が、地域の歴史を読み解く手がかりになるでしょう。 川沿いや水辺では、その土地の暮らしや水との関わりを伝える歴史案内板が見つかるかもしれません。 「旧宇田川家住宅」や「旧大塚家住宅」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":371,"rank":278,"percentile":85.4,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":122,"rank":152,"percentile":91.8,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":26,"rank":980,"percentile":46.4,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":31,"rank":128,"percentile":92.8,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":1,"rank":1563,"percentile":14.5,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":1,"rank":102,"percentile":78.1,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":[],"tourism_landmarks":["旧宇田川家住宅","旧大塚家住宅","行徳塩田","清瀧神社","浦安市郷土博物館","屋形船","三番瀬（谷津干潟）","東京ディズ